msgid "Version 0.4.2: a \"Check the copies in the storage\" button compares the files the storage holds under the same names with WordPress and changes nothing else. Version 0.4.1: files uploaded to the storage by hand while their local copies are still in WordPress are checked and counted as copies. Version 0.4.0: a step-by-step move in either direction, for files moved by hand (FTP) or in stages. Copy everything to the storage or to WordPress without deleting anything, switch where the site serves its files from after a check that every file is there, and delete the copies on one side only when every file has a verified copy on the other. Files brought back by hand are matched by their contents."
